  "checks": [
    "All 25 previously accepted Q3 source pins still match. Full Q3-to-Q4 text diff examined; namespace, status, predecessor and supplement references updated consistently; substantive reader delta is fresh no-follow os.stat rather than DirEntry.stat, retaining hardlink, reparse, device and type predicates, selected native-handle validation, bounded hashing and membership resampling.",
    "New real fixture creates and proves a hardlink and expects the enumeration hardlink refusal outside selected suffix. The three existing ordinary-tree methods remain unchanged, and their later drift assertions require actual execution.",
    "Text-derived roster matches 73 unique entries exactly: 31 foundation, 30 reader and 12 protocol methods. Eight timestamp controls and two sequential fault Jobs remain distinct. Existing limits and lifecycle guards are unchanged from Q3.",
    "Q3 actual review and Root disposition bind its consumed failed operation, 69 passing methods, three errors, eight timestamp controls, no fault Jobs, and scoped owned closure. Q1 custody remains unknown; Q2 precompiler failure remains preserved. Q4 supplement gives only narrow successor treatment and does not release historical custody.",
    "Static hash comparison found no mismatches in 782 preservation baseline files and 732 recorded runtime files. Fresh admission must independently recheck current bytes, runtime, resources and stop conditions."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Static file, text, JSON and SHA256 review only; no AST, import, compile, tests, native workload or Q operation performed.",
    "Windows filesystem metadata semantics, hardlink fixture, timing, process and Job containment, and cleanup require a fresh admitted operation and independent actual-result review. Platform trust is local Windows, PowerShell and .NET without loaded-code attestation; directory membership remains resampled and privileged mutation excluded.",
    "Root must adopt exact supplement and source review, issue fresh admission and use a different actual reviewer. This source review does not establish a Q pass, historical custody or release, restart, boundary, dependency closure, future launch or scientific authority."
